WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.203
-I'm very excited about this.
I have a new holiday song

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:06.239
I'm releasing,
with me and Dolly Parton,

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:08.241
called "Almost Too Early
for Christmas."

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.045
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.045 --> 00:00:15.482
It's out Friday, November 4th.

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:19.686
And. so, I talked
about this last night,

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.288
I put it on TikTok
with the song

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:24.090
and say it's out on Friday.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:27.593
And TikTok took it down.
It's illegal.

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:29.529
-What -- Because --
-Because it's not out yet?

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:30.997
-They said --
Yeah, because it's not out.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:34.667
They said they couldn't
get the rights to...

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.602
So now I'm in a lawsuit
with myself.

00:00:36.602 --> 00:00:38.170
-Oh, my --
You're suing yourself?

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:42.008
-I'm suing myself. And I'm not
returning my phone calls.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:43.375
-Really?!

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:44.810
-I'm gonna let me
sweat it out a little bit.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.112
-Oh, wow. Acrimonious.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.314
-Yeah, 'cause I don't know
if I'm ready -- Really?

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.983
What, am I gonna listen to me,
make decisions about my music?

00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:54.020
-No. F that. F that noise.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.654
-So I don't --
It's a great song.

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:57.356
I can't wait
for people to hear it,

00:00:57.356 --> 00:01:00.226
but I guess
it actually is too early.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.095
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:06.031
TikTok told me it actually
is too early for Christmas.

00:01:06.031 --> 00:01:07.967
The point of the story is,
if you want to --

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:11.871
if you like it, if you want
to retweet it, you can't.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:14.240
Not until Friday.
-Friday.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.908
-Friday it's out.

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:18.244
Thank you, Dolly.
And I'm sorry, me.

